  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to trade-related activities under TradeMark Africa - Capital Developmental Expenditure Limit</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is to support trade-related activities at the Nakonde Border implemented by TradeMark Africa. This programme will be implemented between September 2023 to March 2024. Activities are Capital Developmental Expenditure Limit aligned.</narrative>
